Formula:

Funding loss ≈ Released principal × (Funding cost − Reinvestment yield) × Remaining maturity

Also show:

Loss is not caused simply because the customer prepaid.
Loss arises when funding cannot be repaid and the released funds cannot be reinvested at an equivalent return.

